  concept: "Authored objective: Safe Bridge Load Current.\nAuthored requirement:
    Verify 6 to 9 mA through the 220 ohm load resistor. current \u2265 6 mA. current
    \u2264 9 mA. Connection pair R_LIMIT_Input and R_LIMIT_Output.\nGeneral teaching
    principle: Bridge measurements compare relevant branch conditions and reference
    points; balance must be verified rather than assumed.\nOnly fresh, authoritative
    game evidence can establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: Comparing two scales is useful only when both use compatible reference
    points.
